OL,3,GNEWSA'Iconic' Jubilee clock flattened
OL,4,Aby lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic town clock, built in 1898 to
OL,7,Fmark Queen Victoria's Diamond Jubilee,
OL,8,Fhas been flattened by a lorry.
OL,10,FThe much-loved Grade II listed Jubilee
OL,11,Fclock in Cricklade, Wiltshire, was
OL,12,Fknocked down at about 22:00 GMT on
OL,13,FTuesday, according to the town council,
OL,14,Fwhich owns and maintains the landmark.
OL,16,FChairman Mark Clerk said the clock
OL,17,Foutside the Vale Hotel in the high
OL,18,Fstreet, which was funded by public
OL,19,Fsubscriptions, was "iconic" and that it
OL,20,Fwas a "sad day" for the town.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
