OL,3,GNEWSA'Iconic' Jubilee clock flattened
OL,4,Aby lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cast-iron clock is more than 125
OL,7,Fyears old and had its face repaired
OL,8,Fafter a military vehicle hit it in
OL,9,F1945.
